  "body": "## What changed\n- add a separate manual history outcome field, independent from the technical listing status used by bot processing\n- add retrospective labels: `Kupiłem`, `Ktoś kupił przede mną`, `Oszustwo`, `Telefon z blokadą`, `Inne / ogólne`\n- allow old visible history entries to be relabeled at any time, including clearing the label\n- add counts and outcome filters in History so the labels can be used directly for bookkeeping/statistics\n- show the selected outcome as a badge on each history card\n- keep existing `PURCHASED` entries treated as `Kupiłem`; migration backfills existing purchased rows\n- allow purchase-price correction for an old entry retrospectively marked as `Kupiłem`\n- keep the technical status unchanged when changing bookkeeping labels\n\n## Data model\n- add nullable `listing.history_outcome`\n- Flyway `V37__add_history_outcome_tags.sql`\n\n## Tests\n- preserve hidden-history behavior\n- verify default `PURCHASED_BY_ME` mapping\n- verify retrospective outcome editing\n- verify retroactively purchased entries can have their purchase price corrected",
